  "id": "a91b9bf6-d59b-4cb2-b15a-e6070a5ce327",
  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "ViSTR-Bench and Geo3R both introduce benchmarks to assess MLLMs' spatial reasoning capabilities, while S-Agent introduces a new spatial tool-use paradigm for reasoning over continuous 3D environments. 3D Scene Graph Prediction and Multi-Room Scene Understanding introduces a top-down framework for synthesizing hierarchical 3D scene graphs, combining a room layer and object layer to predict unexplored areas in complex environments. PinpointQA and Chain of Spatial Thoughts introduces a benchmark for evaluating small object-centric spatial understanding in indoor environments, while Spa3R introduces a self-supervised framework for learning a unified, view-invariant spatial representation from unposed multi-view RGB images.",
